Inline math *x*<sup>2</sup> + *y*<sup>2</sup> = *z*<sup>2</sup> inside a
sentence.

$$\sum\_{i = 1}^{n}i = \frac{n(n + 1)}{2}$$

Fractions and roots: $\frac{a}{b}$, $\sqrt{x}$, $\sqrt\[3\]{x}$.

Matrices:

$$\begin{pmatrix}
1 & 2 \\
3 & 4
\end{pmatrix}$$

Cases:

$$\begin{cases}
x\text{ if }y \\
z\text{ otherwise}
\end{cases}$$
